        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Ku oraagarukye Misri, otarireka kukorera omu maisho ga Faraho eby'okutangaaza byona ebi nkuhaire kukora; kwonka ndyagangaaza omutima gwe, tarireka bantu kugyenda. ",
