          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagambira Arooni ati: Irooko oze kubugana Musa omu ihamba. Yaagyenda, yaamubugana aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga, yaamunywegyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaagambira Arooni ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA yaamutumire, n'obumanyiso bwona obu yaamuragiire kukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa na Arooni baagyenda, baateeranira hamwe abakuru b'Abaisraeli boona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni yaabagambira ebigambo byona, ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa, kandi yaakorera obwo bumanyiso omu maisho g'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baikiriza; kandi ku baahuriire ngu MUKAMA ataayaayiire Abaisraeli, yaareeba okubonabonesibwa kwabo, bainika emitwe yaabo, baaramya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.31"
            ]
          }
